Vendored third-party code
-------------------------

spar/third_party/mantis/ contains modules copied from Google Mantis
(https://github.com/google/mantis), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The full license text is in spar/third_party/mantis/LICENSE.

Source commit: e2205c759cc4e24f85665028e5e28933719f7df5

Files and modifications:

- sarif.py   : copied from reference/core/sarif.py. Unmodified except that its three
               deferred imports (from core.database / from core.llm_gateway) are
               repointed to the vendored sibling shims _status and _egress. The SARIF
               construction and validation logic is byte-for-byte upstream.
- evidence.py: copied verbatim from reference/core/evidence.py.
- _status.py : the finding-status tuples and the is_untriaged / is_suppressed
               predicates copied verbatim from reference/core/database.py; the
               surrounding SQLite machinery is not vendored.
- _egress.py : the terminal-control regexes and strip_terminal_control copied
               verbatim from reference/core/llm_gateway.py. The upstream
               sanitize_egress_text also runs a credential scrubber; Spar performs
               secret redaction before this point, so only control-sequence stripping
               is retained.

PyRIT (https://github.com/microsoft/PyRIT, MIT License) is used as an ordinary
installed dependency and is not vendored.
